  m_Name: 2 SoldierResults
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: "So, Jackie, today\u2019s the big day again, you excited to hear your
      test scores?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8121c10b25930fa4dadfab5bd0c5fefe, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3264111934402461768
    - rid: 3264111934402461770
    - rid: 3264111934402461769
    - rid: 3264111934402461767
  - content: "As ready as I\u2019ll be. I\u2019ve been waiting ages for today."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3264111934402461772
    - rid: 3264111934402461775
    - rid: 3264111934402461771
    - rid: 3264111934402461774
  - content: Well, you got here just in time, seems like the broadcast is starting.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8121c10b25930fa4dadfab5bd0c5fefe, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: '*CHZHCKK*'
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 474297f421f8c524e85a2e1640557075, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Good morning citizens of New Haven City.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 474297f421f8c524e85a2e1640557075, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: They discovered a newfound Waste power source five times more efficient
      than what we synthesize today!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 474297f421f8c524e85a2e1640557075, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: This great achievement means a safer city! Celebrate these heroes you
      get the chance.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 474297f421f8c524e85a2e1640557075, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Nevertheless, this broadcast will announce the score of the NITES exam
      candidates in energy units collected, and whether they passed.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 474297f421f8c524e85a2e1640557075, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
